<%# 처음 접속 시 안내 인덱스 — 학생/교직원 로그인 선택 화면(sessions#new). %>
<div class="w-full max-w-md mx-auto text-center">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-ink">로그인</h1>
  <p class="mt-2 mb-8 text-slate">어떻게 로그인할까요?</p>
  <div class="space-y-4">
    <%= link_to student_login_path,
          class: "card block bg-surface-featured text-center" do %>
      <span class="mx-auto mb-2 flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-yellow-light"><%= ui_icon :student, class_name: "h-11 w-11" %></span>
      <span class="block text-xl font-bold text-ink">학생 로그인</span>
      <span class="mt-1 block text-sm text-brand-blue">학교·학급·이름으로 들어가요</span>
    <% end %>
    <%= link_to staff_login_path,
          class: "card block text-center" do %>
      <span class="mx-auto mb-2 flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-surface"><%= ui_icon :teacher, class_name: "h-11 w-11" %></span>
      <span class="block text-xl font-bold text-ink">선생님 로그인</span>
      <span class="mt-1 block text-sm text-steel">교사·관리자·사서 이메일 로그인</span>
    <% end %>
    <%= link_to new_registration_path,
          class: "card block text-center" do %>
      <span class="mx-auto mb-2 flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-teal-light"><%= ui_icon :document, class_name: "h-11 w-11" %></span>
      <span class="block text-xl font-bold text-ink">선생님 회원가입</span>
      <span class="mt-1 block text-sm text-steel">가입 후 바로 활동할 수 있어요</span>
    <% end %>
  </div>

  <%# 체험 계정 원클릭 로그인. 계정이 DB 에 있을 때만(시드 적재 인스턴스) 섹션이 뜬다. %>
  <% if @demo_student || @demo_teacher %>
    <div class="mt-10 border-t border-hairline pt-8">
      <p class="text-sm font-bold text-ink">🚀 바로 체험해 보기</p>
      <p class="mt-1 mb-4 text-xs text-steel">계정 없이 샘플 학급(포항원동초 3-1)을 둘러볼 수 있어요</p>
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <% if @demo_student %>
          <%= button_to demo_login_path, params: { role: "student" },
                class: "btn btn-secondary btn-block" do %>
            <span class="block">학생으로 체험하기</span>
            <span class="mt-0.5 block text-xs font-normal text-steel">3-1 이도현 학생</span>
          <% end %>
        <% end %>
        <% if @demo_teacher %>
          <%= button_to demo_login_path, params: { role: "teacher" },
                class: "btn btn-secondary btn-block" do %>
            <span class="block">선생님으로 체험하기</span>
            <span class="mt-0.5 block text-xs font-normal text-steel">3-1 담임 김지은 선생님</span>
          <% end %>
        <% end %>
      </div>
    </div>
  <% end %>
</div>
